---
import ExamplesTabs from '../islands/ExamplesTabs';
import { examples } from '../data/examples';
---

<section id="examples" aria-labelledby="examples-h" class="border-b border-line bg-bg">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:py-28">
    <h2 id="examples-h" class="font-display text-3xl leading-[1.2] font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
      从一句话到可交付的提示词
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[52ch] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      两个完整示例：一句自然语言请求，如何变成一条目标明确、规格精确的提示词。
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 min-w-0">
      <ExamplesTabs client:visible examples={examples} />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
